    {
      "id": 300,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Dashboard Overview",
      "description": "High-level overview of what this dashboard measures and why it matters to leadership, delivery teams, and developers.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## GitHub Copilot Billing, Seats & AI Credits\n\nThis dashboard combines seat inventory with billing usage so the organization can monitor both **adoption** and **cost-to-value**.\n\n**Leadership:** understand license capacity, active seat coverage, pending cancellations, and the shift from premium requests to AI credits.  \n**Teams:** see which orgs, models, and seat plans drive the most usage and cost.  \n**Developers:** gain transparency into how feature and model choices can affect consumption trends.\n\nUse this dashboard to answer: **What are we paying for, who is using it, and which usage patterns drive billing exposure?**\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.0.0"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "description": "Current number of assigned Copilot seats across the enterprise.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#d08cff",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
